msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.rst:1931
msgid ""
"The '``llvm.amdgcn.av``' intrinsics perform :ref:`store-available<amdgpu-"
"store-available>` and :ref:`load-visible<amdgpu-load-visible>` operations on "
"flat or global memory with *scope* supplied as a metadata argument."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.rst:1936
msgid ""
"The pointer argument can be a global pointer (``addrspace(1)``) or a flat "
"pointer (``addrspace(0)``). Global pointers select ``global_load``/ "
"``global_store`` instructions; flat pointers select ``flat_load``/ "
"``flat_store`` instructions. The cache policy bits are the same in both "
"cases."
msgstr ""

